# Module, layouts, server, rendering

**Agents:** read **`module/<domain>/README.md`** first for the domain you edit. Workflow: **`.cursor/rules/agent-workflow.mdc`**. Platform contracts below — do not duplicate module runbooks in `docs/`.

Read **docs/ui-ux-skills.md**, **docs/naming.md**, **docs/architecture-gaps.md**, **docs/new-feature-checklist.md**, **docs/data-workflow.md**, **docs/layouts.md**, **docs/app-states.md**, **docs/rendering.md**, **docs/server-api.md**, **docs/modules.md**, **docs/features.md**, **docs/packages.md**.

## Four layers (dependency direction)

```text
apps/*  →  module/*  →  features/*  →  packages/*
```

| Layer        | Path                         | Owns                                                                 |
| ------------ | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Apps**     | `apps/*`                     | Routing, layouts, thin re-exports — almost no business rules         |
| **Modules**  | `module/<domain>/`           | Domain server, client, utils/shared, per-domain README               |
| **Features** | `features/<name>/`           | Cross-domain reuse (authz, auth UX, patterns, …) — see **features.md** |
| **Packages** | `packages/*` (`@loftlancer/*`) | Vendor SDK / infra only — no product business logic                  |

**CI:** **`pnpm audit:architecture-layers`** (import direction). **`pnpm audit:module-architecture`** (oRPC + module contracts). Before merge to **`dev`:** **`pnpm verify:dev-merge`**.

## Import aliases (prefer for new code)

| Layer    | Alias        | Example                                      |
| -------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |
| Apps     | `@/`         | `@/lib/orpc`                                 |
| Modules  | `@modules/`  | `@modules/teams/server/...`                  |
| Features | `@features/` | `@features/authorization/utils`              |
| Packages | `@packages/` | `@packages/drizzle`                          |

Dual support: **`@module/*`** = **`@modules/*`**; workspace **`@loftlancer/*`** alongside **`@packages/*`** ([AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md), [docs/tooling.md](../docs/tooling.md)).

## Naming

- **Modules:** **`<layer>.<slug>.<role>.<ext>`** — `utils.` \| `server.` \| `client.` ([naming.md](../docs/naming.md); **naming.mdc** on `module/**`).
- **Features:** **`<feature>.<purpose>.<suffix>`** under `features/<name>/src/` — see [features/NAMING.md](../features/NAMING.md).
- **Packages:** provider-prefixed files under `src/{core,config,constants,types,utils}/` — see [docs/packages.md](../docs/packages.md).

## Data

- **ServiceResponse** on every controller: `success` \| `failed` \| `error`; validate in `module/shared/utils`; UI toast + body ([data-workflow.md](../docs/data-workflow.md)).

## Actions & audit

- Action IDs: **`features/authorization/src/constants/authorization.registry-data.ts`** → import **`@features/authorization/utils`** ([actions-and-events.md](../docs/actions-and-events.md)).
- **`runAction`:** **`@modules/shared/server/run-action`** (re-exports **`@features/authorization/core/server`**) — permission + audit (all outcomes) + handler.

## Routes & layouts

- Read **docs/layouts.md** and **.cursor/rules/layouts.mdc** when editing `app/**/layout.tsx` or module `client/…/layout/`.

## Rendering & states

- Logic in functions; components render props; client islands via `dynamic()` + skeleton.
- Route `loading/error/not-found/forbidden` + in-page ServiceResponse phases — tier-stable skeletons ([app-states.md](../docs/app-states.md)).
- **UI work:** read [ui-ux-skills.md](../docs/ui-ux-skills.md) and relevant `.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md` before editing module `client/` or **`@packages/ui`** / **`features/*`** client surfaces.

## Server

- Domain API logic in **`module/…/server/`** (and feature server in **`features/…/src/core/server/`** when cross-domain).
- **oRPC:** thin procedures in **`@packages/orpc`** / **`packages/orpc/src/orpc/`** → module controllers; no new tRPC ([server-api.md](../docs/server-api.md)).

## Packages vs features vs modules

- **New domain behavior** → **`module/<domain>/`** only (not `packages/orpc/src/modules/*`, not fat `apps/*/page.tsx`).
- **Reused across domains** → **`features/<name>/`** (features must not import **`@modules/*`**).
- **DB, Better Auth, mail, env, Sentry, crypto, MCP glue, UI primitives** → **`packages/`** only.
